  "title": "Ground Beef Enchiladas",
  "description": "These are beef filled tortilla shells baked in a creamy chicken soup and cheese sauce. My husband absolutely loves these. I served them to guests once with Mexican rice, and they went home with the recipe! Enjoy!",
  "authors": [
    "Vanessa Robbins"
